<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - World Airways raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - World Airways raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alex. Brown said it upgraded World Airways Inc to buy from market perform.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- World Airways said Monday it resolved contractual issues with Philippine Airlines and it expects no material change in its financial results.</p>
<p>-- World Airways also said it entered a new pact with  VASP of Brazil.</p>
<p>-- World Airways gained 1-5/8 to 7-3/4.</p>
</text>
